    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk the \"opinionated tiny creatures\" thing sounds a bit weird haha. but i get what u mean about the smell. how do i know if something is actually wrong though? like can the starter just die off or do things go bad in a way that looks like something else is going on in there?",
      "source": "evaluator"
